  logo: new URL('/images/bohol-logo-horiz-dark.webp', Astro.site).href,
  description: 'Direct manufacturer and OEM/ODM engineering powerhouse operating a 35,000 m² cleanroom campus with 120+ automated assembly lines, Class 100,000 medical LSR liquid silicone injection, and global DDP fulfillment.',
